This document differs from p_b7c2 (which claims the lunchbox, vitamins, and journal go out) and from p_b2e9/p_4a7c (which claim everything stays home). The evidence is unambiguous: the lunchbox is found at cupboard_k1 on 8 of 8 weekday afternoon looks, the vitamins at counter_k1 on 7 of 8, the journal at desk_b1 on 6 of 8. Meanwhile the backpack, keys, shoes, wallet, notebook, and water bottle are found at their resting spots on only 2 of 8 afternoon looks—meaning they are out 6 of 8 times.

