# p_9d4e — Guitar to the Bedroom Floor: Yuki's Evening Practice 17:00–21:30

Yuki moves her guitar from the living-room couch to the bedroom floor for her evening practice. The patrol passes show it at bedroom_floor_b1 at 18:00 and 20:00 (two sightings each, versus one on the couch), then back on the couch by 22:00. The transition in is between the 16:00 pass (couch) and the 18:00 pass (bedroom floor), so roughly 17:00–17:30. The transition out is between 20:00 (bedroom floor) and 22:00 (couch), so roughly 21:00–21:30.

This document differs from p_8f2b, which places the guitar on the bedroom floor only 18:00–20:00 (too narrow—the 20:00 pass still shows it there), and from p_8c3d, which places it on the couch 22:00–23:30 (correct for the return but silent on the bedroom-floor window). It also corrects the mixture's persistent error of predicting couch_l1 when the guitar is actually on the bedroom floor at 18:00 and 20:00.

